The local WebSocket client of the Bose speakers and the Bose account sign-in
(src/bose/) were written in JavaScript for this project. Bose does not
document them: the descriptions of the pybose project
(https://github.com/cavefire/pybose) and of the Bose integration for Home
Assistant (https://github.com/cavefire/Bose-Homeassistant), both GPL-3.0 and
by cavefire, served as the reference for the protocol (resources, message
headers, sign-in steps, public identifiers of the Bose app); no code was
copied from them.

It uses the npm package "ws" (MIT, https://github.com/websockets/ws).

Bose is a trademark of Bose Corporation. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed or supported by Bose. It talks to the speakers and to the Bose
account with the same requests as the Bose app, which an update may change
without notice.
